5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"Since we are all moving together, I want to make sure we consider how our placement affects our communication. I'll look into the two project strands within earshot last spring and what this year's two joiners reported.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I want to ensure the distribution of seats is fair. I will check the drawn plan against the staff survey and the unplanned seat shuffles in the past year.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think it's important to know the costs. I'll look into the basis of the department's floor billing and the facilities quote for re-running power and network.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mio,,I want to know how this affects our daily flow! I'll check the morning routine on the pilot floor upstairs and the arrival times in the badge records.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I'll handle the physical side of things. I'm looking into the sound meter readings across the room and the physio's note from the workstation check.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"Does anyone else feel we should look into the human element more, or are we satisfied with these choices?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"I believe the current selection covers the necessary bases. We have the financial, physical, and social aspects accounted for.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I agree... if everyone is okay with these, then I think it's enough.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Mio,,I'm totally on board! It feels like we've got a great mix of data points to help us decide.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,It's a comprehensive enough list. No need to overcomplicate the research phase; let's just get the data.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I'm glad we're all in agreement. I'll start gathering the information on the project strands and the new joiners right away.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I will proceed with the survey and shuffle records. It is better to have the facts before we start debating the layout.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I'll... I'll go ahead and check the billing and the quotes then.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Mio,,I'll dive into those badge records and the pilot floor routine! I'm curious to see how much time we're actually talking about.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I'll get the sound readings and the physio's notes. Let's see if the reality of the room matches the plan.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I think we have a solid plan for this first step. Let's all take our time with the research and meet back here to share what we've found.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Toshio,,Agreed. I will ensure my findings are precise so we can avoid any ambiguity when we reconvene.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I'll do my best to be thorough... I'll see you all soon.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Mio,,Can't wait! See you all in a bit!,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
